<title>UK: LME copper hovers near day's highs, nickel firmer.</title>
<headline>LME copper hovers near day's highs, nickel firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Wandering around top end of day's range. Cash/threes backwardation widens out from AM to 75/$77.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Shadowing copper. Quiet.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ticks higher, probing $7,400 level.</p>
<p>TIN - Firmer. OTHERS - Easier.</p>
</text>
